'''Knights''' are enemies that can normally only be damaged from their exposed brains on the backs of their heads. However, explosions, attacks that pierce enemies ({{i|Brimstone}}, {{i|Cupid's Arrow}}, etc.), or melee attacks ({{i|Spirit Sword}}, {{i|Mom's Knife}}, etc.), will deal damage from any direction. The Knight normally walks around in random directions and will dash at Isaac if he is within line of sight.

